desc:
/// We recommend playing this game with a group of friends; otherwise, it will be boring so INVITE THEM!! /// This is a simple horror game: you and your friends or just you must survive seven days in a house during Holy Week. Each night, the chances of an entity appearing increase...

 Survive however you can. This game relies heavily on teamwork. It wasn't made with any serious intent; it's mainly for having fun and getting a few scares..

You'll have to figure out what each entity does. Support this game if you want more updates.
